        "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\"><title>Astraeon character factory review</title>\n<style>body{background:#14232c;color:#edf1ea;font:16px system-ui;margin:24px}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:24px}.controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin:16px 0}label{display:grid;gap:5px}button,select,input{font:inherit;padding:7px}canvas{background:#d7d7d7;width:min(100%,640px);height:auto;display:block}.warning{color:#f2c67b}#status{white-space:pre-wrap}fieldset label{display:inline-flex;margin:8px}button{cursor:pointer}#integrity-results{max-height:320px;overflow:auto;font-size:12px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px}td,th{padding:8px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #456}#guide-image{width:min(100%,512px);background:#ddd}details{margin:24px 0}#queue-scroll{overflow:auto}</style>\n</head><body><main><h1>Character factory \u00b7 retained Swordsman</h1><p class=\"warning\">Development review \u2014 original tall artwork, incomplete character package. No runtime approval.</p>\n<div class=\"controls\"><label>Action<select id=\"action\"><option value=\"SkillOverhead\">SkillOverhead</option><option value=\"BasicAttack\">BasicAttack</option><option value=\"SkillSwapPrototype\">SkillSwapPrototype</option></select></label><label>Authored direction<select id=\"direction\"><option value=\"SW\">SW</option><option value=\"NW\">NW</option><option value=\"NE\">NE</option><option value=\"SE\">SE</option></select></label><label>Head + hair<select id=\"head\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"gold\">gold</option></select></label><label>Body + costume<select id=\"body\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"gold\">gold</option></select></label><label>Weapon<select id=\"weapon\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"gold\">gold</option></select></label><label>Playback<select id=\"speed\"><option value=\"0\">Paused</option><option value=\"1\">Source review speed</option><option value=\"0.25\">Quarter speed</option></select></label><button id=\"replay\" type=\"button\">Replay once</button><button id=\"previous\" type=\"button\">Previous frame</button><button id=\"next\" type=\"button\">Next frame</button></div>\n<label>Frame <input id=\"frame\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" value=\"0\"><output id=\"frame-label\">2 / 15</output></label><label><input id=\"onion\" type=\"checkbox\">Previous-frame onion skin (review only)</label><fieldset id=\"layers\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-role=\"WeaponLightBack\">WeaponLightBack</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-role=\"BodyCostume\">BodyCostume</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-role=\"WeaponLightFront\">WeaponLightFront</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-role=\"HeadHair\">HeadHair</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-role=\"WeaponHandOccluder\">WeaponHandOccluder</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" data-role=\"Weapon\">Weapon</label></fieldset><canvas id=\"stage\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" aria-label=\"Same-frame layered character\"></canvas><p id=\"status\" role=\"status\">BasicAttack \u00b7 SW \u00b7 frame 2 \u00b7 60 ms\nOne shot, holds final frame \u00b7 fixed 512 \u00d7 512 source canvas\nOwner naturalness and basic-attack suitability review pending\nManual anatomy/cutout edges provisional\nPer-view front/back FX staging approximate\nPrevious frame overlay enabled</p><p>Every layer shares the original frame canvas. Four real attack views; no mirroring. Cosmetic options appear only for matching pose sets.</p><a href=\"../docs/character-factory/PATCH001_MASTER_PLAN.md\">Production plan and acceptance gates</a><details id=\"integrity\"><summary>Check retained master and cutout reconstruction</summary><p>Checks all 128 original attack/skill frame views. Pixel equality does not approve anatomy, grip, trail or hidden surfaces.</p><button type=\"button\" id=\"check-integrity\">Check original cutouts</button><p id=\"integrity-status\" role=\"status\">Not checked in this session.</p><pre id=\"integrity-results\"></pre></details><details id=\"production\"><summary>Production queue \u00b7 all 19 Swordsman actions per body</summary><p>Guide coverage and technical cutout receipts are separate from art and gameplay approval.</p><label>Body target<select id=\"queue-body\"><option value=\"male\">Male</option><option value=\"female\">Female</option></select></label><p id=\"queue-status\" role=\"status\">19 target actions \u00b7 1 technical receipts \u00b7 art/gameplay acceptance pending \u00b7 896 protected source files verified</p><div id=\"queue-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Action</th><th>Required views \u00d7 frames</th><th>Guide PNGs</th><th>Cutout intake</th><th>Visual/gameplay gate</th><th>Inspect source</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"queue-rows\"><tr><td>Walk</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Run</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Sprint</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Hit</td><td>8 \u00d7 12</td><td>96 / 96</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Death</td><td>8 \u00d7 20</td><td>160 / 160</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Interact</td><td>8 \u00d7 12</td><td>96 / 96</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Pickup</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>ItemUse</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Sit</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Respawn</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Idle</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>CombatIdle</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>BasicAttack</td><td>4 \u00d7 16</td><td>64 / 64</td><td>Technical receipt present</td><td>Pending \u00b7 historical review 16 frames</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>SkillAction</td><td>4 \u00d7 32</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending \u00b7 historical review 16 frames</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>CastChannel</td><td>4 \u00d7 16</td><td>64 / 64</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>CastRelease</td><td>4 \u00d7 16</td><td>64 / 64</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Guard</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>Dash</td><td>8 \u00d7 16</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr><tr><td>SpinAttack</td><td>4 \u00d7 32</td><td>128 / 128</td><td>Missing intake</td><td>Pending</td><td><button type=\"button\">Guide</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><section id=\"guide-panel\" hidden=\"\"><h2 id=\"guide-title\">Source guide only</h2><div class=\"controls\"><label>Guide direction<select id=\"guide-direction\"></select></label><button id=\"guide-previous\" type=\"button\">Previous guide frame</button><button id=\"guide-next\" type=\"button\">Next guide frame</button><label>Guide frame<input id=\"guide-frame\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"></label></div><p id=\"guide-status\" role=\"status\"></p><img id=\"guide-image\" alt=\"Blender motion guide; not final character art\"></section></details></main><script src=\"character-factory.js\"></script><script src=\"swordsman-production-queue.js\"></script>\n</body></html>",
